wo  characters because it feels like it's  more than that but i don't think i'll  get into all that right now this seems  like a pretty good place to leave things  let me know what you think about his  answers what you think about season two  please like this video if you enjoyed it  please subscribe to my channel if you  haven't already and thanks for watching  i'll talk to you soon
 

